Hi,

I wrote a tutorial to gather all what need NFSV4 administrators and 
end-users to easily
configure NFSV4 within a secure Kerberos environment. This document has 
been built
from my own experience in testing the installation and the robustness of 
NFSV4 with
Kerberos and also from experiences of others who have published it on 
the web.

It is certainly not complete. Let me know at aime.le-rouzic@bull.net 
what is missing
and also some real-life examples of Kerberos NFSV4 deployments.
We will find the document at http://nfsv4.bullopensource.org

Thanks

